<content><![CDATA[<media-image source="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/haxtheweb/art/main/presentation-materials/hax-the-web-intro/media/stills/title-lock.jpg" alt="HAX / THE / WEB in red neon pixel letters, with a light bar over the A and bars flanking THE."></media-image>
<p>A 30-second neon title sequence. Credits tell the HAX story from a napkin in 2015 to hundreds of courses while red neon letters drift by, then lock into the HAX / THE / WEB mark. Play, pause, scrub, or read every credit as text.</p>
<p><em>A fan homage to the synth-scored opening titles of a 1980s-set TV series. The letters, credits and type are HAX's own.</em></p>
